{"id":"27e776c7d53cca65","group":"68","path":"68/68-thm-arithmetical-hierarchy.md","title":"Arithmetical Hierarchy","display":"thm-arithmetical-hierarchy — Arithmetical Hierarchy","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-thm-arithmetical-hierarchy","aliases":["68-thm-arithmetical-hierarchy"],"display":"thm-arithmetical-hierarchy — Arithmetical Hierarchy","depends_on":["[[68-df-arithmetical-hierarchy]]"],"source_edition":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF","source_location":"§13.4-13.5 pp.47-48; §13.2 p.44 / PDF 56-57,53","verification_status":"source-adapted-theorem","source_proof_status":"source-proof-and-adaptation-reviewed"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-thm-arithmetical-hierarchy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-thm-arithmetical-hierarchy</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-arithmetical-hierarchy — Arithmetical Hierarchy"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5e61d0905238a638\" href=\"?note=5e61d0905238a638\" title=\"68-df-arithmetical-hierarchy\">68-df-arithmetical-hierarchy</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§13.4-13.5 pp.47-48; §13.2 p.44 / PDF 56-57,53"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-adapted-theorem"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"source-proof-and-adaptation-reviewed"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_n^0,\\Pi_n^0\">\\(\\Sigma_n^0,\\Pi_n^0\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5e61d0905238a638\" href=\"?note=5e61d0905238a638\" title=\"68-df-arithmetical-hierarchy\">68-df-arithmetical-hierarchy</a> 的一元层级。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，第 0 层取递归集合。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\left(\\exists A\\in\\Pi_n^0\\;(A\\notin\\Sigma_n^0)\\land\\exists B\\in\\Sigma_n^0\\;(B\\notin\\Pi_n^0)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\left(\\exists A\\in\\Pi_n^0\\;(A\\notin\\Sigma_n^0)\\land\\exists B\\in\\Sigma_n^0\\;(B\\notin\\Pi_n^0)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\left(\\Sigma_n^0\\subsetneq\\Sigma_{n+1}^0\\land\\Pi_n^0\\subsetneq\\Pi_{n+1}^0\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\left(\\Sigma_n^0\\subsetneq\\Sigma_{n+1}^0\\land\\Pi_n^0\\subsetneq\\Pi_{n+1}^0\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>第一式是原书 13.5，印刷 pp.47–48 / PDF pp.56–57 的一元结论：以 13.4 的 Π_n 二元枚举关系 P 构造 D(e)↔P(e,e)，若 D 也为 Σ_n，则其补集为 Π_n 且与自己的枚举索引处矛盾。交换两类得到另一半。13.2 的虚量词添加给出较低层到下一层的包含；正层 n 的 Π_n∖Σ_n 见证落在 Σ_(n+1)，从而使 Σ_n 的包含严格，另一类对偶。第 0 层的严格性来自 n=1 的非自对偶见证，因为递归集合同时属于 Σ_1 和 Π_1。已核对原书证明及此第 0 层延伸。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-arithmetical-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"5e61d0905238a638","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-arithmetical-hierarchy]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-arithmetical-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"5e61d0905238a638","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma_n^0,\\Pi_n^0$ 是 [[68-df-arithmetical-hierarchy]] 的一元层级。$n\\in\\mathbb N$，第 0 层取递归集合。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma_n^0,\\Pi_n^0","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\left(\\exists A\\in\\Pi_n^0\\;(A\\notin\\Sigma_n^0)\\land\\exists B\\in\\Sigma_n^0\\;(B\\notin\\Pi_n^0)\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\left(\\Sigma_n^0\\subsetneq\\Sigma_{n+1}^0\\land\\Pi_n^0\\subsetneq\\Pi_{n+1}^0\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1559,"backlinks":[{"id":"be41c4d7dd143cb1","anchor":"ref-111","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-thm-arithmetical-hierarchy]] — theorem"},{"id":"3cb8c24064050ea6","anchor":"ref-158","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-thm-arithmetical-hierarchy|thm-arithmetical-hierarchy — Arithmetical Hierarchy]]"}],"outgoing":["5e61d0905238a638"]}